msgid "Interfaces"
msgstr "Interfaces"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:3 863e88760c114ff4b2152a301dacd65d
msgid ""
"**Vite student/professor workbench:** preserves separate learning and review"
" authority."
msgstr ""
"**Vite student/professor workbench:** preserves separate learning and review"
" authority."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:4 df5e6a863fb343cab005575a696e3539
msgid ""
"**ffed-qlc command line:** use only through the documented repository route."
msgstr ""
"**ffed-qlc command line:** usar solo mediante la ruta documentada del "
"repositorio."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:5 7d3514a3e5e447a0ba27428e7c18a9aa
msgid ""
"**FastAPI `/api/v1`:** requires the reviewed Gateway contract for real alpha"
" sessions; liveness remains distinct from readiness."
msgstr ""
"**FastAPI `/api/v1`:** requires the reviewed Gateway contract for real alpha"
" sessions; liveness remains distinct from readiness."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:6 9a04b9882f92490abcfccc3221475b91
msgid ""
"**Vigil report:** schema-validates evidence and limitations but never "
"assigns a final grade or security certification."
msgstr ""
"**Vigil report:** schema-validates evidence and limitations but never "
"assigns a final grade or security certification."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:8 5e85a27ae3e6473b85c488eea74816f8
msgid "Interface contract"
msgstr "Contrato de interfaz"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:10 20de4ef17b8d4537abb9653bdf557f28
msgid ""
"Inputs must be explicit, outputs must be inspectable, errors must be "
"returned as errors, and consequential external actions require human "
"approval."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas deben ser explicitas, las salidas inspeccionables, los errores "
"devueltos como errores y las acciones externas importantes requieren "
"aprobacion humana."

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:12 285319ddaa494b47be9ab4b738e67d95
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "Compatibilidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/ffed-qlc/interfaces.md:14 2ff69b2462914f7cbcf06fb0a07f42ab
msgid ""
"Treat undocumented endpoints, commands, and browser controls as unsupported."
" Confirm the current repository version before integrating another system."
msgstr ""
"Considere no compatibles los endpoints, comandos y controles del navegador "
"no documentados. Confirme la version actual del repositorio antes de "
"integrar otro sistema."

